title: 'pallet-revive: document an implicit assumption explicitly'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: The public API method `emit_contract_log_outside_frame` allows consumers
    to emit arbitrary contract logs. However, off-chain tooling may assume a log at
    address X is to be treated as emitted by code at address X. This is not something
    which is generally guaranteed by the runtime; runtime code can already deposit
    the same event through frame-system anyway. But we can inform
    future consumers that there may consumers having this assumption.
crates:
- name: pallet-revive
  bump: patch
